h `str(url)`.\n- Two mypy errors remain in `resolver.py` (lines 1219 and 1342). I didn't touch that file, so they predate this change.", "ttft_ms": 1131, "type": "result", "duration_ms": 219580, "uuid": "a92df38b-6b25-4fdf-8345-5b27deeb08a6", "ttft_stream_ms": 994, "time_to_request_ms": 106, "first_content_frame_ms": 994, "queued_turn_count": 0, "result_index": 0, "timestamp": "2026-10-09T15:45:00.279Z"}